Lemonade Stand History File
$VER:Lemonade_Stand_V2.5

Version 0.1 - 0.99
          ->First test run on local BBS.

Version 1.0 -
          ->First public version.

Version 1.1 -
          ->Fix a bug: There was a small bug in if it rained on the
                       last day of the month, it would not end and
                       you would keep on playing.
          ->Other    : Added some color to areas that lacked it in 1.0

Version 1.2 -
          ->Fix a bug: Fixed a small bug in the high scores area.
          ->Other    : Removed the hard coded 'pfiles:lemon/' and added
                       a PATH='pfiles:lemon/' at the start so that sysop's
                       that do not use PFILES will have a better time.

Version 1.3 - 1.9 Not Released!
          ->Fix a bug: <NONE>
          ->Other    : Worked out the ideas for version 2.0

Version 2.0 -
          ->Fix a bug: <NONE>
          ->Other    : Added a 'Save Game' feature. Now users can play
                       some then exit and have the game saved for later
                       play. Saved games are stored in the users mail dir.
                       This way, should the users ever be deleted from
                       your system, the game file will be removed too.
                     : Removed the graphics from the main code and added
                       then into the SCREENS dir. This makes it easier
                       for sysops to create their own custom screens.
                     : Added a few more EVENTS... Just for fun;)
                     : Added Time Reward Feature. Sysop definable.

Version 2.1 -
          ->Fix a bug: Fixed the day/money save bug!
          ->Other    : <NONE>

Version 2.2 -
          ->Fix a bug: Fixed a random bug! Looks to have been because of
                       not saving a value in the save file. I hope;)
          ->Other    : <NONE>

Version 2.3 -
          ->Fix a bug: Fixed a few more bugs that popedup.
          ->Other    : Program now deletes the save game file from the
                       players mail: once they complete a game. This
                       should help keep disk space usage down. Cleaned
                       up the code a bit more.

V2.3 Note: Now that the machanics of the game are in place and working right,
           I can now start on improving the game play itself more.

Version 2.4 -
          ->Fix a bug: <NONE>
          ->Other    : With version 2.4, the game will now check to see if
                       the user last played/saved a game under an older
                       version of Lemonade Stand. In which case it will
                       delete the old save file and the user can start a
                       new game. This is to prevent errors that might pop
                       up should the newer version use another format of
                       save file than an older one did.

Version 2.5 - 2.9 beta (These are not released)
          ->Fix a bug: <NONE>
          ->Other    : A large number of new features have been added.
                     : New Events and a new special one time event.
                     : There are now many SPECIAL hidden keys throughout
                       the game for users to find and enjoy. They can
                       partake of many new activities if they can find the
                       right keys. There's a whole new world in the making!
                     : New for 3.0 POG milkcap game in game.
                     
Pre v3.0 Notes: There are many hidden keys to special areas of the game. Do
                not inform the users of this but let them find them for
                themselves. In time, the news of these keys will come out.                     

Future: Create more ansi screens. Improve game play. Tighten code.
        Maybe a RIP version sometime:/ An external config file?

Far Future: Add RIP screens to the game.

<EOF>
